Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:20:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Support mixed-precision BSR products (GH-2069)

Allow float32 matrix storage to be applied to float64 vectors without allocating a converted matrix. Perform products, accumulation, and scaling in the vector precision while retaining existing dispatch.

Signed-off-by: Wenbo Ji <36562829+fusheng-ji@users.noreply.github.com>
